WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.101
Open Settings → Call limits

00:00:03.101 --> 00:00:05.311
Turn it on

00:00:05.311 --> 00:00:07.904
Set the maximum calls to one person

00:00:07.904 --> 00:00:11.925
Choose the rolling window

00:00:11.925 --> 00:00:19.008
Check the projected impact

00:00:19.008 --> 00:00:25.479
Click Save, then Save limit
